      "releaseNotes": "I’ve been catching up on gun community YouTube stuff and it’s wild what guys are accepting to declare a rifle accurate \nWelcome to BX 4.2! Our team has been working hard on this release after a full rebuild with 4.0. We have a fresh new look which will allow us a better foundation for some new features in the future. This new release now offers Rifle Profiles and the “3x3 Target” which has Automation built in; Size Reference and POA are now automated to save steps. The 3x3 is designed to be shot at 100 yards with 3x rounds on each bull. Once processed, you will get combined data and BX Performance Score which is based on a weighted ratio of Mean Radius, Radial SD, and MOA.\n\nWhile we have worked very hard to make this release stable and with all the functions working. If you experience an issue or something we have missed, email us and we will address it immediately! Ballisticxapp@gmail.com",
